  "break_cases_doc": "BACKEND-ONLY (the FE never grades). The 🚀 supply-break read through enterable.read(kind='supply_break'), on the critique's own demo geometry (M1, 2026-09-15): a lid 98-100, the next lid 130-132, yesterday's close 97. Room to the next lid is the whole rule (his call, spec 7.6); what changes here is the WORD a print already past zone_edge.BROKE_MAX_PCT through the lid gets - 'break_extended', never 'no lid break'. reason_short is compared as a prefix so the served value can quote the constant.",
